songbirds.  Consider the advice offered by Dr. Laake almost exactly a
year ago to a Distance user who wanted to estimate population size at
multiple levels of sampling.  You might find the approach Dr. Laake in
message 861 of this archive (posted 2 Nov 2005 at 07:44) proposes to be
of use in your current situation.  He refers to consultation of some
formulae in the book, which I believe he means Chapter 3 on covariate
models by Marques and Buckland of the Advanced Distance Sampling book.

